            "detailed_description": "<strong>Town of Night</strong> is a First-Person Dungeon Crawler inspired by games like Shining in the Darkness, Etrian Odyssey, Diablo and Wizardry.<br>In Town of Night you play as Corr Algrimm. Hero, Scholar, ladies' man and expert Sword fighter - All self proclaimed.<br><br>Corr is visiting the Town of Night, a strange little town that makes money with Dungeon and Monster hunting tourism, to find out where the monsters are coming from.<br><br>In Town of Night you can recruit different members to your party to go dungeon crawling like you want to.<br>Remember to bring Ink and Paper to draw your own map and try not to die.<br><strong><br>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><br></li><li>    5-10 Hour Campaign<br></li><li>    6 Different Recrutable Heroes<br></li><li>    Looting and Levelling<br></li><li>    First Person Dungeon Crawling</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Town of Night</strong> is a First-Person Dungeon Crawler inspired by games like Shining in the Darkness, Etrian Odyssey, Diablo and Wizardry.<br>In Town of Night you play as Corr Algrimm. Hero, Scholar, ladies' man and expert Sword fighter - All self proclaimed.<br><br>Corr is visiting the Town of Night, a strange little town that makes money with Dungeon and Monster hunting tourism, to find out where the monsters are coming from.<br><br>In Town of Night you can recruit different members to your party to go dungeon crawling like you want to.<br>Remember to bring Ink and Paper to draw your own map and try not to die.<br><strong><br>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><br></li><li>    5-10 Hour Campaign<br></li><li>    6 Different Recrutable Heroes<br></li><li>    Looting and Levelling<br></li><li>    First Person Dungeon Crawling</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Town of Night is a RPG-First-person dungeon crawler hybrid. Visit the town that sits atop a series of vast and dangerous dungeons. Explore, battle, loot and survive!",
