                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I like the hybrid top-down and 1st person dungeon crawling, visual transition is cool and Oco Oco is super cute! Also the music is very atmospheric and I buy it for low price on sale. \n\nPero the controls in 3D dungeon are so clunky and camera movement make me dizzy. Also where to go??? Complete lack of quest guidance, I talk to 3 random people and they join my party for no reason jajaja. Also no fullscreen mode and sometimes the game crash. Es weird and boring but charming at same time. \n\nI give 3/5 stars, please add more hints for quest and fix bugs por favor!",
